<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭdis</span></b>  (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>nom. sing.</i> only, <i><span class="en">Plin. 32,
				10, 54, § 154</span></i> infra), is,
			f., <i>a stake</i>, <i>pile</i> (syn.: palus, sublica). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sudes stipitesque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 1, 27</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				B. G. 5, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7,
				524</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quadrifidae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					2, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fraxineae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 359</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 6, 559</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quominus putrescerent sudes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 14, 24</span></i>
			 § 101 al. — In sing.,
				<i><span class="en">Ov. M. 12, 299 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 6,
			174</span></i>.—As a weapon: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multa vulnera sudibus facta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					40, 6, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tib. 1, 10, 65</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sudes in terga erectae,</span>”
				<i>bristles</i>, <i>spines</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					4, 128</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">densae,</span>”
				<i>thorns</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saxeae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>rocky peaks</i>, <i>crags</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 195, 26</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a kind of pike</i>
			(a fish); perh. Esox sphyraena, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 32,
				10, 54, § 154</span></i>.</div>
